{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12035": "NIKOLAI: 这是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12036": "NIKOLAI: 有些人我见过。我们应该在齐卡隆的梦里，或者类似的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12037": "NIKOLAI: 我觉得他不会做梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12038": "NIKOLAI: 这些多半都是他保存的别人的记忆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12039": "ALEXANDRA: 朱娜？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12040": "ALEXANDRA: 哎，还以为快出去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12041": "ALEXANDRA: 右边那条路刚打开。能找找有没有总开关之类的东西吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12042": "NIKOLAI: 开关？齐卡隆的开关多半长得像个人，没准真就是个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12043": "NIKOLAI: 要我猜，得找个非常、非常古老的人。穿得大概也很怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12044": "ALEXANDRA: 祝好运！（我们都需要……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12045": "JUNA: 你创造了齐卡隆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12046": "OLD MAN: 嗯？原来的魔像，还是复制体？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12047": "JUNA: 不知道，怎么分？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12048": "OLD MAN: 你知道希纳尔出了什么事吗？风暴与黑暗的事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12049": "JUNA: 呃，不知道，应该算是……历史谜团吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12050": "OLD MAN: 那我们一定在复制体里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12051": "JUNA: 怎么解开这些记忆？我的朋友困住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12052": "OLD MAN: 困住？人不可能以肉身进入齐卡隆的记忆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12053": "JUNA: 要是有人魔法天赋很高，技巧却不太成熟……偏找到了办法呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12054": "OLD MAN: 齐卡隆的所有记忆，都从核心的最初记忆中延展开来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12055": "OLD MAN: 从那边过去，祝你朋友好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronRabbi-12056": "OLD MAN: 去齐卡隆的核心，联结就在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12057": "MAN: 他醒了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12058": "OLD MAN: 法术已经完成，不管醒没醒，他都能听见我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12059": "WOMAN: 还剩多少魔力？伤病的人这么多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12060": "MAN: 想治也治不了，魔力已经完全断流了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12061": "MAN: 只有齐卡隆这样的造物，能把魔力储存起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12062": "OLD MAN: 即使如此，不补充魔力，他也只能听，别的什么都做不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12063": "WOMAN: 要是去希纳尔的人再也不回来呢？要是魔法真的就此消失呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12064": "OLD MAN: 那齐卡隆就会是我们最后的造物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12065": "AGATA: 希纳尔……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12066": "JEROME: 这应该是……数千年前？魔法被重新发现之前。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12067": "NIKOLAI: 醒醒，伙计，你已经不在那个时候了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12068": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12069": "ALEXANDRA: 不知道你们刚做了什么，不过出口打开了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12070": "ALEXANDRA: 真奇怪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12071": "ALEXANDRA: 他们创造齐卡隆时用的魔法，和维持这座监狱的魔法，居然……兼容。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12072": "ALEXANDRA: 像是同一家工厂造的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12073": "ALEXANDRA: 总之，我看到出口了，应该是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12074": "JEROME: 到科黛莉娅梦境旁会合，好吗？想离开这里，必须先救她出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12075": "NIKOLAI: 她能做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12076": "JEROME: 说不准，不过她确实是这一代最出色的魔法学者之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12077": "JEROME: 谁要是知道这座监狱的本质，一定是她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikaronCreation-12078": "ALEXANDRA: 好，到那里会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluLibraryWarp-12079": "JUNA: 居然使出这种损招……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12080": "JEROME: 科黛莉娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12081": "CORDELIA: 重复刚才的谈话，只会耽误我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12082": "JEROME: 请听我说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12083": "JEROME: 你现在不在议会大楼，也不是在制定政策。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12084": "JEROME: 我们困在某种幻象矩阵里，是尼古拉那个世界山下的一座监狱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12085": "LEONA: 这有失他的身份，你不觉得吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12086": "CORDELIA: 很遗憾，确实。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12087": "BEN: 我来，我一出现，她就知道自己在做噩梦了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12088": "BEN: 嘿，女士！知道你忙着给袜子按字母排序什么的，可就不能帮我们一下？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12089": "BEN: 哦，非得这样是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12090": "BEN: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12091": "ALEXANDRA: （这才对。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12092": "CORDELIA: 亚历珊德拉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12093": "CORDELIA: 亲爱的，不知道你怎么穿过了结界，不过现在真的没空。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12094": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……你在忙什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12095": "CORDELIA: 筹建机构。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12096": "CORDELIA: 各个世界要经受住重新调整，就必须有严密的法律基础。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12097": "CORDELIA: 监督与管理世界之间往来的机构，必须迅速建立、配齐人员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12098": "CORDELIA: 国际外交与法律的关键，在于由自己创立、掌握机构，让别人加入。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12099": "CORDELIA: 否则，他们会另建对立组织，冲突便会蔓延各处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12100": "ALEXANDRA: 我，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12101": "ALEXANDRA: 不知道这些是什么意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12102": "CORDELIA: 总有一天，不知道会有多快……我们都将不在这世上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12103": "CORDELIA: 到那时呢？我们不在了，谁去阻止乌拉尔特那样的人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12104": "CORDELIA: 机构能比创立者存在得更久，比如那些致力于维护和平的机构。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12105": "ALEXANDRA: 好，我想明白了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12106": "CORDELIA: 那你就明白事情多紧迫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12107": "ALEXANDRA: 不，我是说……也许吧，可我想明白的是另一层意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12108": "ALEXANDRA: 你在害怕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12109": "CORDELIA: 我何时让你觉得胆怯过？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12110": "ALEXANDRA: 我是说，你不像其他人那样害怕，确实没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12111": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈生病时，我什么都不敢做，什么改变都害怕。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12112": "ALEXANDRA: 可你正好相反，你不顾危险、冒险行事，是因为怕自己早早死去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12113": "ALEXANDRA: 是因为你父亲吗？我不知道全部的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12114": "ALEXANDRA: 抱歉，我只是想说，我能理解。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12115": "ALEXANDRA: 杂货店算不上什么“机构”之类的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12116": "ALEXANDRA: 可我想让家里的店一直开下去，因为我爱妈妈，也想把属于她的一部分留在身边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12117": "ALEXANDRA: 我只是说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12118": "ALEXANDRA: （……我到底在说什么？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12119": "ALEXANDRA: 我想……爱也能在你离开后留下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12120": "ALEXANDRA: 要是为了一些法律，反倒错过了这样的爱，那也太可惜了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12121": "CORDELIA: 虽然还需打磨，不过你似乎颇有修辞天赋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12122": "CORDELIA: 看来，你的天赋还不止我们已经见识过的那些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12123": "ALEXANDRA: 还有，不明白你为什么觉得自己会早逝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12124": "ALEXANDRA: 你每天吃几个无花果、喝一杯茶就能活下去，说不定还能活到一百一十岁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12125": "ALEXANDRA: 真该担心的是我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12126": "CORDELIA: 什么……谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12127": "CORDELIA: 刚才那些是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12128": "JUNA: 某种醒着也会陷进去的梦，这里还有别的家伙，是它困住了我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12129": "JEROME: 希望你能弄清，那是谁……或者是什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12130": "CORDELIA: 有人试过彻底离开这里吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12131": "ALEXANDRA: 试过，有屏障，内外两层，我之前就困在这两层之间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12132": "ALEXANDRA: 更外面还是洞穴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12133": "CORDELIA: 是把我们……关在里面？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-finalCordGlu-12134": "CORDELIA: 我有个猜想，到洞穴最边缘就能验证。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEdgeNote-12135": "JUNA: 外缘大概就在这一段的尽头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12136": "CORDELIA: 果然。不过我原以为规模更小，而且应当在地表。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12137": "CORDELIA: 也许以前确实如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12138": "NIKOLAI: 什么东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12139": "CORDELIA: 看来，这里是一座星界石阵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12140": "CORDELIA: 希纳尔人如何监管帝国内的魔法，我们所知很少，只知道他们极其擅长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12141": "CORDELIA: 从流传至今的古代见闻中，我们可以确定一件事：希纳尔人每征服一片新领土，就会将帝国的边界实际向外挪动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12142": "CORDELIA: 通常就是在新边界上安置一座这样的石阵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12143": "CORDELIA: 这些石阵以某种方式“容纳”了将帝国联结起来的庞大法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12144": "CORDELIA: 而这一座似乎被改了用途，禁锢的范围小得多，只针对这里的某个存在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12145": "CORDELIA: 有人能感知这座平台里的魔法吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12146": "ALEXANDRA: 能，是土系魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12147": "CORDELIA: 记载若准确，石阵四角应当各自束缚着一种元素的法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12148": "CORDELIA: 直接解开，应该就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12149": "JUNA: 之后呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12150": "CORDELIA: 至少我们就能离开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12151": "AGATA: 那和我们一起在这里的东西呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12152": "CORDELIA: 它可能阻止，也可能不会，取决于束缚它的契约。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12153": "NIKOLAI: 什么契约？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12154": "CORDELIA: 先别管，很快就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12155": "CORDELIA: 现在，得派四种元素的法师，分别前往石阵四角。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12156": "AGATA: 每人还得有个帮手。肯定有某种防护法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-astralHengeDivide-12157": "CORDELIA: 那么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12158": "CORDELIA: 谁和亚历珊德拉去地之石阵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12159": "朱娜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12160": "阿伽塔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12161": "杰罗姆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12162": "齐卡隆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12163": "CORDELIA: 谁和尼古拉去火之石阵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12164": "朱娜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12165": "阿伽塔",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12166": "杰罗姆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12167": "齐卡隆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12168": "CORDELIA: 谁和本去风之石阵？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12169": "朱娜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-grottoPartySelect-12170": "阿伽塔",
